        "created_at": "2018-02-20T10:48:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This week we get a 5 on 1 against the Mad Bomber himself.&nbsp;</p><p>FV Tachyon, Dark Visionary, Rook City Wraith, The Eternal Haka and Termi-nation Bunker are the ones the world are counting on.&nbsp;</p><p>The Visionary and Wraith can just take the environment&nbsp;offline and you never have to see a Kraken unless you want to.&nbsp;<span>Also, there are 2 living forcefields back to back making Tachyons base power mostly useless for a bit.</span></p><p><span>I managed to get a Mint, however, I haven't the foggiest&nbsp;idea how after the pounding I took trying to get through those living forcefields.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
