        "created_at": "2018-02-20T15:28:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint despite mostly ignoring the environment in favor of controling BB's Deck.&nbsp; Only had 2 under him when the Kraken ate his last bomb.&nbsp; Flip side was considerably easier, as I let him build up his trash and avoid playing cards.&nbsp;</p><p>9 point Inventory Barrage into a nice, big Taiha slam took him out on&nbsp;the last turn.</p>",
