      {
        "id": 214671,
        "name": "bolnerap",
        "username": "bolnerap",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-02-21T01:05:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Easy Mint, final HP 15 / 15 / 20 / 33 / 16. My combination of deck control and damage mitigation meant that of the three turns the Kraken got, two of them hit Blade and the other, it was under Hypersonic Assault. Bunker opened Foam Grenade, then Dark V buried Leaking Room and had Bunker dump his hand for Toxic Seaweed. Everybody else did as much damage as they could early and ignored Devious Disruption - that way, we could keep a couple equipment cards out for the second half of the fight. In the last round, Haka healed to full just because he could.</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:45:56.017Z",
